<!-- ============================================================
     BUOC 3 - GIO HANG

     Anh Tony chot 12/09: dung ANH "Aquaria & song Vam Co" (canh 5),
     nhin THANG XUONG, khung hinh om tron khu phan lo.

     🔴 Anh KHONG chep sang day - tro thang sang ../pano/ cua trang
     Thuc te. Cung mot goc web nen duong dan tuong doi chay tot,
     va khoi nhan doi 8,7 MB tile.

     🔴 GOC NHIN DO BANG MAY, KHONG DOAN (12/09):
       h = 90   v = 90   fov = 37
     Cach ra so nay:
       1. Tinh nguoc tu canh4 (da chot h=165 top-down):
          yaw canh4 = -8.2 · yaw canh5 = 172.3 -> lech 180.5 do
          => h canh5 ~ 165 - 180.5 = -15.5
          Kiem chung: ath(canh5->canh4) - ath(canh4->canh5)
                    = -41.2 - (-40.7) = -0.5 = 180 - 180.5  ✔ cong thuc dung
       2. Nhung -15.5 van nghieng ~13 do so voi anh Anh Tony gui
          -> do tiep bang cach chup anh roi so 1:1, ra h = 90.
       3. fov: lay 2 HO BOI xanh lam moc do khoang cach.
          Anh Anh Tony: 2 ho cach nhau 31,8% be ngang khung.
          fov 40 -> 30,2%  ·  fov 38 -> 31,0%  ·  fov 36,5 -> 31,1%
          => chot fov 37.
          ⚠️ KHONG do theo khung do Anh khoanh - khung do ve tay,
             khong phai ranh gioi that.

     🔴 BAY 12/09 (da dinh): dat view NGAY SAU loadscene la vo ich -
        <view> cua scene va action onstart chay SAU se ghi de.
        Vi vay goc nhin phai nam trong chinh <view> nay.

     Engine krpano 1.19-pr16 - BAN DA MUA cua ERA.
     ============================================================ -->

<autorotate enabled="false" />

<!-- 12/09: giu nguyen cau hinh CHONG SAY XE da chot -
     quan tinh chuot thap, khong tween zoom khi vao canh. -->
<control mousespeed="8.0" mousefriction="0.5" mouseaccelerate="1.0" />

<action name="startup" autorun="onstart">
  loadscene(get(scene[0].name), null, MERGE);
</action>

<!-- ==================================================================
     🔴🔴 BAY 50 (MOI, 12/09 toi) - KHONG DAT THANG vlookat=90 TRONG <view>

     Nadir (v=90) la DIEM KY DI: nhin thang xuong thi camera khong con
     huong "len" xac dinh. Khai bao thang v=90 trong <view> thi krpano
     BO QUA LUON hlookat - da do h=0 · h=90 o ca v=89 lan v=90,
     BON lan ra ANH GIONG HET NHAU, xoay 90 do so voi anh Anh Tony gui.
     🔴 Doc so bao ve van thay dung "hlookat: 90" nen rat de tuong da dat dung.
        Chi chup anh ra moi lo. Cung ho bay T10 - con so noi doi.

     ✅ Cach chay duoc: vao canh o goc THUONG (v=45, giong canh5 ben trang
        Thuc te), doi mot nhip cho <view> + onstart chay xong, ROI MOI xoay
        xuong nadir BANG JS ben index.html. Luc do hlookat con y nghia, krpano giu goc xoay khi
        di len cuc. Day dung la trinh tu da chup duoc anh khop voi anh Anh Tony.
     ⚠️ Da thu <action>+delayedcall trong chinh file nay: KHONG CHAY,
        view van dung nguyen o <view> (do duoc h=5 v=45 fov=105).
        Nen viec xoay xuong nadir lam ben index.html.
     ================================================================== -->
<!-- 🔴 TEN SCENE DUNG GACH DUOI, KHONG GACH NGANG (16/09).
     `doiCanh()` ben index.html goi `loadscene(pk_aqua, ...)` KHONG nhay -
     y het cach trang Thuc te lam. Ten co gach ngang thi krpano doc thanh
     PHEP TRU (bay da ghi trong CLAUDE.md muc 5) -> ten vut di, tra ve null,
     man den, KHONG mot dong loi nao.
     Ten cu la `gio-hang`, chi duoc tham chieu trong chinh file nay
     (da grep ca thu muc) nen doi ten khong pha gi. -->
<scene name="pk_aqua" title="PK The Aqua" onstart="">
  <!-- 🔴🔴 DA DINH VA DA GO (12/09 toi): ban dau Em Teo dat limitview="range"
       kem hlookatmin/max 65..115 de "khoa khong cho lac mat khu dat".
       => HONG: voi limitview="range" krpano ep fov NHO LAI cho vua dai goc
          da khai bao. Dai ngang chi 50 do nen no zoom sat rat, mat han
          khung hinh Anh Tony chot. Chup anh moi lo ra.
       => Tro ve limitview="auto" giong het 2 trang kia. Muon chan lac thi
          phai lam bang nut "ve goc chuan", KHONG lam bang limitview. -->
  <!-- 🔴 BO GIOI HAN PHAI Y HET canh5 ben trang Thuc te (fovmin 45 · fovmax 115
       · maxpixelzoom 1.0 · limitview auto). Anh Tony chup anh mau TREN CHINH
       canh do, nen giu nguyen bo so nay thi khung hinh moi ra dung nhu anh.
       Doi mot trong bon so la khung hinh nhay - da thu va da sai 2 lan. -->
  <!-- Goc XUAT PHAT lay y nguyen cua canh5 ben trang Thuc te.
       Goc DICH (nadir) do JS trong index.html dat sau 700ms - xem BAY 50. -->
  <view hlookat="5.0" vlookat="45.0" fov="105.0"
        fovtype="HFOV" fovmin="30.0" fovmax="140.0"
        limitview="auto" maxpixelzoom="1.0" />
  <preview url="../pano/05-aquaria-song-vam-co/05-aquaria-song-vam-co.tiles/preview.jpg" />
  <image type="CUBE" multires="true" tilesize="512">
    <level tiledimagewidth="2624" tiledimageheight="2624"><cube url="../pano/05-aquaria-song-vam-co/05-aquaria-song-vam-co.tiles/%s/l3/%v/l3_%s_%v_%h.jpg" /></level>
    <level tiledimagewidth="1280" tiledimageheight="1280"><cube url="../pano/05-aquaria-song-vam-co/05-aquaria-song-vam-co.tiles/%s/l2/%v/l2_%s_%v_%h.jpg" /></level>
    <level tiledimagewidth="640"  tiledimageheight="640"><cube url="../pano/05-aquaria-song-vam-co/05-aquaria-song-vam-co.tiles/%s/l1/%v/l1_%s_%v_%h.jpg" /></level>
  </image>
</scene>

